<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Abide in Thee! my Savior God, I know</l><l>How love of Thine so vast in me may flow,</l><l>My empty vessel, running o’er with joy,</l><l>Must overflow to Thee without alloy.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Abide in Thee! nor doubt, nor self, nor sin,</l><l>Can e’er prevail with Thy blest life within;</l><l>Joined to Thyself, communing deep, my soul</l><l>Knows naught besides its motions to control.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Abide in Thee! ’tis thus I only know</l><l>The secrets of Thy mind e’en while below—</l><l>All joy and peace, and knowledge of Thy word,</l><l>All pow’r and fruit, and service for the Lord.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
